msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_LINUVALI_000_041:1"
msgid "<split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> must <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>dance</ui-edge-color></ui-color> atop the statues, laying bare <if $gn4>her<else>his</if> spirit to the judgment of our ancestors. Only with their approval can <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> earn the right to the sundrop dance."
msgstr "Вам нужно <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>танцевать</ui-edge-color></ui-color> на обеих статуях, открыв душу суду наших предков. Лишь с их одобрения <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> получат право исполнять танец капли звезды."

#. ja: さあ、さあ、まずは目の前にある、<br>始祖なる母を象った「始まりの岩」の上に乗ってください。<br>そして、思い切り「踊る」のです！
#. de: Felsen mit herrlich üppigen Rundungen, vor dem <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eeh steht, ist Urfelsen, der heiliger Stammmutter von Vanu-oohs nachgeformt ist. <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eeh soll auf ihn steigen und tanzen, was dünne Beine hergeben!
#. fr: Je te propose de commencer par celle qui se trouve ici. Tout ce que tu as à faire, c'est d'aller sur la tête et d'effectuer quelques pas d'une <i>danse</i> de chez toi.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_LINUVALI_000_042:1"
msgid "Here lies the first statue: the mother of all Vanu. Go, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>dance</ui-edge-color></ui-color> atop the statue with zeal!"
msgstr "Перед вами первая статуя — праматерь всех вану. Вперёд, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>танцуйте</ui-edge-color></ui-color> на ней от всей души!"

#. ja: さあ、さあ、まずは目の前にある、<br>始祖なる母を象った「始まりの岩」の上に乗ってください。<br>そして、思い切り「踊る」のです！
#. de: Na-Vanu-eeh soll auf Urfelsen steigen und tanzen, was dünne Beine hergeben!
#. fr: Pour commencer, va sur la tête de la statue de nos ancêtres qui est ici et effectue quelques pas d'une <i>danse</i> de chez toi.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_LINUVALI_000_045:1"
msgid "Dance atop the statue with all the power you can muster!"
msgstr "Танцуйте на статуе изо всех сил!"

#. ja: 「始まりの岩」の上で思い切り「踊る」ことで、<br>バヌバヌ族の始祖に冒険者の魂を示した！
#. de: Du hast auf dem Urfelsen einen beeindruckenden Tanz hingelegt und vor den Vanu-Urahnen deine unbefleckte Seele entblößt.
#. fr: Vous avez effectué quelques pas de danse sur le rocher des anciens pour vous présenter aux ancêtres des Vanu Vanu<nbsp>!
#. speaker: SYSYTEM
msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_SYSYTEM_000_048:1"
msgid "You lose yourself in the dance, and lay bare your spirit to the Vanu Vanu ancestors!"
msgstr "Вы отдались танцу и открыли душу предкам вану-вану!"

#. ja: 岩の印の上でエモート「踊る」をして、<br>バヌバヌ族の始祖に冒険者の魂を示そう。
#. de: Steige auf den Urfelsen und beweise den Vanu-Urahnen durch Tanzen (Emote: Tanzen; Textbefehl: /tanz) die Unbeflecktheit deiner Seele.
#. fr: <i>Dansez</i> sur le rocher des anciens pour vous présenter aux ancêtres des Vanu Vanu.
#. speaker: SYSYTEM
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_SYSYTEM_000_049:1"
msgid "Submit your spirit to the Vanu Vanu ancestors with a rousing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>dance</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. "
msgstr "Откройте душу предкам вану-вану зажигательным <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>танцем</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: さすが、さすが、狂い咲いた花のように情熱的な踊りでした。<br>次は始祖なる父を象った、もうひとつの「始まりの岩」がある、<br>「ブンド・オク・ベンド」へ向かいましょう。
#. de: Linu Vali-ooh ist mitgerissen von <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eehs Tanz wie von rauschendem Wildfluss! Jetzt muss <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> noch auf Urfelsen tanzen, der heiligem Stammvater von Vanu-ooh nachgeformt ist. Befindet sich in Vundo Ok' Bendo. Eilen wie Wirbelwind!
#. fr: Je t'ai regardé<if $gn4>e</if> danser d'en bas, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>. Je suis sûre que nos ancêtres ont été im<shy>pres<shy>sion<shy>nés. Rendons-nous près de Vundu Ok' Bendu maintenant, c'est là-bas que se trouve l'autre statue.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_LINUVALI_000_050:1"
msgid "The violent winds of a monsoon gale could not match the ferocity of <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>'s dance. One more statue remains: the father of all Vanu. Linu awaits at Vundu Ok' Bendu!"
msgstr "Ярость в танце <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> не сравнится даже с ветрами муссонного шторма! Осталась ещё одна статуя — праотец всех вану. Лину ждёт вас у Вунду Ок' Бенду!"

#. ja: 次は、あの始祖なる父を象った「始まりの岩」の上に乗って、<br>思い切り、思い切り、踊ってきてください。<br>遠いけれど、私はここでちゃんと見届けていますよ。
#. de: Hier ist Urfelsen, der heiligem Stammvater von Vanu-ooh nachgeformt ist. <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>-eeh soll auf ihn steigen und tanzen, bis dünne Beine rauchen wie Vulkanschlot!
#. fr: Le deuxième rocher des anciens se trouve sur l'île qui est de l'autre côté de la passerelle. Là aussi, il faut que tu fasses quelques pas d'une <i>danse</i> de ton peuple sur la statue. Je vais t'attendre ici.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan006_02169:TEXT_BANVAN006_02169_LINUVALI_000_060:1"
msgid "Climb atop the statue and show the father of all Vanu your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>dance</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Do not hold back─the statue stands strong against the most thunderous stamps. Go, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, Linu Vali watches from here."
msgstr "Взберитесь на статую и покажите праотцу всех вану свой <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>танец</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Не сдерживайтесь — статуя выдержит даже самые мощные удары ног. Вперёд, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! Лину Вали будет смотреть отсюда."

#. ja: 次は、あの始祖なる父を象った「始まりの岩」の上に乗って、<br>思い切り、思い切り、踊ってきてください。<br>遠いけれど、私はここでちゃんと見届けていますよ。
#. de: Na-Vanu-eeh soll auf Urfelsen tanzen, der heiligem Stammvater von Vanu-ooh nachgeformt ist. Muss tanzen, bis Beine umknicken wie Bäume bei Sturm! Linu Vali-ooh wird von hier aus zusehen und fest an Na-Vanu-eeh denken.
#. fr: Le deuxième rocher des anciens est juste en face, sur l'île de l'autre côté de la passerelle. Je vais attendre ici pendant que tu fais quelques pas d'une <i>danse</i> de ton peuple sur la statue.
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
